  m_text: Haul actual cargo across load-sensitive ice. Darkening ice and cracks warn
    of cumulative stress. Heavy cargo and hard impacts increase risk. Choose the
    wider marked thick-ice route or risk a short crossing. Deliver the connected
    trailer upright and stopped in the northern depot. A breakthrough is a real loss
    of support, not a random failure roll.
